</ul></nav></section><section class="front-matter"><div class="ameta p font-secondary font-xs">
<hgroup><h1>The neural basis of ideological differences in race categorization</h1></hgroup><div class="cg p">
<a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Krosch%20AR"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id1"><span class="name western">Amy R Krosch</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id1">
<h3><span class="name western">Amy R Krosch</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup><sup>1</sup></sup>Department of Psychology, Cornell University, 211 Uris Hall, Ithaca, NY 14853, USA</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Krosch%20AR"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Amy R Krosch</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>1,</sup><sup>✉</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Jost%20JT"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id2"><span class="name western">John T Jost</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id2">
<h3><span class="name western">John T Jost</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup><sup>2</sup></sup>Department of Psychology, New York University, 6 Washington Place, New York, NY 10003, USA</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Jost%20JT"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">John T Jost</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>2</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Van%20Bavel%20JJ"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id3"><span class="name western">Jay J Van Bavel</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id3">
<h3><span class="name western">Jay J Van Bavel</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup><sup>3</sup></sup>Department of Psychology and Center for Neural Science, New York University, 6 Washington Place, New York, NY 10003, USA</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Van%20Bavel%20JJ"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Jay J Van Bavel</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>3</sup>
</div>
<ul class="d-buttons inline-list">
<li><button class="d-button" aria-controls="aip_a" aria-expanded="false">Author information</button></li>
<li><button class="d-button" aria-controls="anp_a" aria-expanded="false">Article notes</button></li>
